{
  "_note": "补录提交:把某一天**显式**设为三态之一(含清除标记)。\n与 toggle.af 的循环语义不同 —— 那个服务高频的今天,这个服务低频的补录。\n\n做法:先把该日期从两个串里都摘干净(`t0`/`s0`),再按选择追加到目标串。\n这样「清除标记」天然就是「只摘不加」,不需要单独一支。\n\n⚠️ 同样带**合法性闸**:算不出日期就一个字节都不写(见 toggle.af 里那条注释)。\n⚠️ 全用纯表达式,不用 `op:if` —— operation 的分支退出时会恢复外层绑定,\n   里面 `op:set` 出来的键拿不到外面。\n⚠️⚠️ **表单值必须经 `@event.value.*` 取**:字符串式绑定的 flow 初始 scope 只有 `@event`(协议 §D),\n   裸 `${date}`/`${state}` 恒空 → `ok` 判 0 → 一个字节都不写,而且不报错(2026-08-21 iOS 实测)。\n⚠️⚠️ **流必须自己调 `page.close`**:宿主「只看流有没有主动要求关闭,不看成败」,不调就一直挂着\n   = 用户看到的「点保存没反应」。上面那条注释说的「表单提交后自己关页」,少的就是这个动作。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "taken",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": { "key": "taken", "default": "_" }
    },
    {
      "id": "skipped",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": { "key": "skipped", "default": "_" }
    },
    {
      "_note": "下面三项只给「停药期不响提醒」用(2026-10-15):补录的是服药期最后一天时,要知道下一盒哪天开始。",
      "id": "start", "action": "data.get", "params": { "key": "start", "default": "" } },
    { "id": "active", "action": "data.get", "params": { "key": "active", "default": 21 } },
    { "id": "rest", "action": "data.get", "params": { "key": "rest", "default": 7 } },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": { "key": "d", "value": "${@event.value.date}" }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": { "key": "st", "value": "${@event.value.state}" }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": { "key": "ok", "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${d}),10),1,0)]" }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": { "key": "tag", "value": "$[connect::(_,${d},_)]" }
    },
    {
      "_note": "先摘干净:两个串里都不再有这一天。`replaceAll(串,_日期_,_)` 会把两侧哨兵合并回一个。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": { "key": "t0", "value": "$[replaceAll::(${taken},${tag},_)]" }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": { "key": "s0", "value": "$[replaceAll::(${skipped},${tag},_)]" }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nt",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok},0),${taken},if::(eq::(${st},taken),connect::(${t0},${d},_),${t0}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ns",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${ok},0),${skipped},if::(eq::(${st},skipped),connect::(${s0},${d},_),${s0}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "data.set",
      "params": { "key": "taken", "value": "${nt}" }
    },
    {
      "action": "data.set",
      "params": { "key": "skipped", "value": "${ns}" }
    },
    {
      "_note": "补录**今天**且选的是「已服」时,撤掉当天那一发服药提醒(doc/alert-design.md §4.4,\n三条记录路之一,另两条在 xWidget/flow/mark-today.af 与 page/flow/toggle.af)。\n\n补录这条路的全部意义就是「填过去的日子」,所以日期闸在这里最要紧:补录上周三那一笔\n与今天该不该响毫无关系。⚠️ 比**毫秒**不比日期串(VParser 的 eq 先数字化,日期串是未定义行为),\n故先把两边各自 parseDate 成 ms —— 这三条 op:set 就是为这道闸新加的。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": { "key": "tStr", "value": "$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd)]" }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": { "key": "tMs", "value": "$[parseDate::(${tStr},yyyy-MM-dd)]" }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": { "key": "dMs", "value": "$[parseDate::(${d},yyyy-MM-dd)]" }
    },
    {"_note": "与 toggle.af 同一套日历算术:这一天在本盒的第几格。", "op": "set", "props": {"key": "sd0", "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${start},2026-01-01)]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "sMs0", "value": "$[parseDate::(${sd0},yyyy-MM-dd)]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "cyc", "value": "$[calc::(${active}+${rest})]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "dIdx", "value": "$[round::(calc::((${dMs}-${sMs0})/86400000))]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "inPack", "value": "$[calc::(${dIdx}%${cyc})]"}},
    {"_note": "停药期不响提醒(2026-10-15):算「下一盒第一天零点」的带时区 ISO 时刻,交给 `alert.skip` 的 `until`。\n⚠️ `until` 四端只认带偏移的 ISO(iOS ISO8601DateFormatter / Android OffsetDateTime 都要偏移;iOS 解析不出会让整条流报错),\n   而 formatDate 只出本地时间、没有时区占位符,所以偏移要自己算:\n   本地零点 bkNsMs 与同一天的 UTC 零点之差就是偏移。UTC 零点 = 2026-01-01 的 UTC 毫秒(常数 1767225600000)+ 整天数,\n   整天数 = (bkNsMs − 本地 2026-01-01 零点)/ 一天 再四舍五入 —— 两端只差夏令时,四舍五入不会错一天。\n   ⚠️ 别把基准换成 1970-01-01:基里巴斯 / 萨摩亚 1970 年后跨过日期变更线,偏移差超过 12 小时,会算错整整一天\n   (= 新一盒第一天的提醒被吞掉)。2026-10-15 用 numable run 在上海 / 纽约 / 加德满都 / 基里巴斯 / 萨摩亚 / 奥克兰 / 纽芬兰 / 伦敦 × 四个日期实测全对。\n⚠️ 显示用的整数都套 `round::`(Android calc 出 double,否则拼成 `+8.0:0.0`)。\n⚠️ bkNoon 取正午锚点(同 w.df 的 baseMs),按天累加时给夏令时留余量。", "op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkNoon", "value": "$[calc::(${sMs0}+(floor::(calc::(${dIdx}/${cyc}))+1)*${cyc}*86400000+43200000)]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkNs", "value": "$[formatDate::(${bkNoon},yyyy-MM-dd)]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkNsMs", "value": "$[parseDate::(${bkNs},yyyy-MM-dd)]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkRef", "value": "$[parseDate::(2026-01-01,yyyy-MM-dd)]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkU", "value": "$[calc::(1767225600000+round::(calc::((${bkNsMs}-${bkRef})/86400000))*86400000)]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkOff", "value": "$[round::(calc::((${bkU}-${bkNsMs})/60000))]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkSg", "value": "$[if::(lt::(${bkOff},0),-,+)]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkAbs", "value": "$[round::(if::(lt::(${bkOff},0),calc::(0-${bkOff}),${bkOff}))]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkOh", "value": "$[round::(floor::(calc::(${bkAbs}/60)))]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkOm", "value": "$[round::(calc::(${bkAbs}-${bkOh}*60))]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkOhS", "value": "$[if::(lt::(${bkOh},10),connect::(0,${bkOh}),${bkOh})]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkOmS", "value": "$[if::(lt::(${bkOm},10),connect::(0,${bkOm}),${bkOm})]"}},
    {"op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkIso", "value": "${bkNs}T00:00:00${bkSg}${bkOhS}:${bkOmS}"}},
    {"_note": "补录的是服药期最后一天(且确有计划、有停药期):记「已服」后一直撤到下一盒第一天零点。只在下面「补录今天 · 已服」那道闸里用。", "op": "set", "props": {"key": "bkLong", "value": "$[if::(eq::(length::(${bkNs}),10),if::(eq::(length::(${start}),10),if::(gt::(${rest},0),if::(ge::(${dIdx},0),if::(eq::(${inPack},calc::(${active}-1)),1,0),0),0),0),0)]"}},
    {
      "_note": "三条一起成立才撤:合法(`ok==1`)· 是今天(`dMs==tMs`)· 选的是「已服」(`st==taken`)。\n⚠️ `params` 省略 = 本规则全部实例;幂等;只撤到今天零点,明天照常响 —— 不是关闭提醒。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${bkLong},1),0,if::(eq::(${ok},1),if::(eq::(${dMs},${tMs}),if::(eq::(${st},taken),1,0),0),0))]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "alert.skip",
          "params": {
            "id": "dose",
            "until": "today"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {"_note": "同上一道闸,但补录的今天是服药期最后一天:整个停药期都不用吃,一直撤到下一盒第一天零点(用户 2026-10-15)。", "op": "if", "props": {"val": "$[if::(eq::(${bkLong},1),if::(eq::(${ok},1),if::(eq::(${dMs},${tMs}),if::(eq::(${st},taken),1,0),0),0),0)]"}, "items": [{"action": "alert.skip", "params": {"id": "dose", "until": "${bkIso}"}}]},
    {
      "_note": "不在这里 reloadPage —— 表单提交后自己关页,由 open-log.af 的 openForResult 回来后整页重载。\n但仪表盘那张卡与桌面小组件不在那条链上,得自己踢一下(同 toggle.af 结尾)。",
      "action": "widget.refresh"
    },
    {
      "_note": "收口:告诉宿主可以关表单了(见顶注第二条)。回传值不消费 —— 状态已写进 data.*,\nopen-log.af 的 openForResult 收到 nil 后整页重载。",
      "action": "page.close"
    }
  ]
}
